  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418c44d0dbc213b3a486ee7b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是美妙姿势哦！\r\n与我一同打开通往未来的门扉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c739e5fca0239e69458096b23529f87b8c6a1eb70ffbaeb049dbcf392e129622",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1022/95010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159ef02b7f40b9ee161ec52d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1a602f76e0821564afc652f284f3f09fbdb4d7fa777de6ee1a11303e1db441",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/1000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c43ca0cfc662d746f8be106",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我──想要和可靠的伙伴，\r\n无止境地追寻\r\n更加贴近胜利的理论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04600415170c64926ca6a23a7699625849e55e03320574efd4a096745b7dc9ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f60368e744e1c34d10acc5e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "100000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/100000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1af72c5bcec69ba4911c6e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "戻ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb603bcbaf54388661ce8ddfcaa8d5fc2aa49d8bacf52392c7a69c44dc9517b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "100001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/100001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf5cd1a8d885f5d984dbe38",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的话语……一瞬间就溜进我内心。\r\n在我动脑思考前就能理解了，\r\n你真的是个很奇妙的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "019862bc77acacde1cd1392801ccf865e6350bab4fe4adc82b7816563c3c0356",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c63df1ae1f0afc832af97fe6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……唔，意外地不会被注意到呢。\r\n呃，我换了一种护发油……不过离\r\n丝滑柔顺的印象似乎还差很远啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cda1fac23dff5bbc4cf19f8f9ccb5f9ca9e5d8a735ef833a1f9d5bceac44ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c2925b0839cf20e7fe9128c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n我们赶紧来协调往后的计划吧。\r\n新年也不能松懈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df8747522866b6d88e7ad2c1580fdfb03be696301697e6667e4002409f65e67f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d557ec7573e64df19180f94",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节也是个\r\n传达平时感谢的日子。\r\n你愿意接受我的谢意吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26ba76c9c18e403d52436256b4781af6a4d87fb9e5f974e4846c62ac8b35dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e197d3e3c41bebf9fd2b2c12",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "外观、味道、包装的平衡──\r\n这份手工巧克力考虑到了所有要素。\r\n……希望你会喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31432102a546204e3ed378b5b08631155243020244d0171ae2a5eda587f8fe1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7c1a1fbbeff83efc3ed947",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将愿望化为言语并使之可见，\r\n七夕真是极其合理。\r\n……你说不浪漫？唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ec3a2cbe4aaeadae77fa43d87dbe3d1c700cdd8e218af137f277041a1587a49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788b862b6d4c639012758061",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实我替白仁\r\n准备了鬼怪形状的点心……\r\n她已经不是那种年纪了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "681dccbfc72ea90c1ef84a02be9c7b651d7eba1204b6ed5b0e1edeab7acfba9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e79af15067f04dc1afe61d6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是的，可恶的奖券。竟然把别人的\r\n头发当成圣诞老人的胡子玩。\r\n……一点都不像吧？你说啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc54f7f90a21465b483792639f217ee482f41615081f2291bae558241c08ec3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd93d0bfe604f9a36b3d03c7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回忆有时会成为强烈的动机。\r\n换言之……与你一同度过的圣诞夜，\r\n我会让它转变为迈向未来的动力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c19207a9ef5070339ae6deb68a99b8c3a6d3e20d14748eec222c89bbfa904c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a749caf435da95f1fd1abd1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是我们通力合作的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabcf80897d3226e3f942c6beac8f0be1c2a137ad49acfec4d95b8604e444098",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc3251fdbbebd45d7e3d430",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年也是眨眼间就过了。\r\n时间的流逝明明是相等的才对……\r\n自从遇见你之后，感觉就过得很快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c066eb37b0e6aaca21c06f56714c7a57b66574451446c5b077fdb314d64d5e4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8f0188513d0dc6851abdae",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日呢。\r\n但愿你能度过美好的一天，\r\n获取崭新的知识及学问。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d851c7ddd4824dada899ff762e3165b8a6b6b0c004703f7070d8dfc52d5dd7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7c841e76beb8cd3f381b3e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，训练员君。\r\n……说来也奇怪，\r\n帮忙庆生的我反而觉得相当开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1717d4da19507ea2bbcbd98e787b9a1b181a80a0d035b821eab3e879aef84c18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9168237010f7abad2f794b8e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员君，谢谢你的祝福。\r\n我会加紧努力，\r\n回报你的期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4947ce8a46747bb4f67c55c1a84bdb99906024de908b21040800a93e386e62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85d6348d428b9b4c2fdab115",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……原来如此。我现在总算理解了。\r\n我所期盼的礼物……\r\n就只是一句来自于你的祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb35e6c331118c57f2ac9bc42d18187fe29319a40185205f0de98cce4a7a887",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75dcb60ce76bfa8508adef0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好像收到公告了。\r\n可能是什么重要事项要传达，\r\n我建议你早点确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59aedef34cf3932ad9908239c2d6875ea6c4554bb0feabb73332f7c2ba0fffde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da1c16534c9a2da26359ba0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有礼物送来了。\r\n你也挺有两下子的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "031e27234bc1c65bc2cc7764b15ce9e5b0c1c8c49e063c45ad5d5d1c34340202",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fd825d30e31f0b4ed22f994",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "似乎有任务完成了。\r\n这个公正的评价回报了你的努力，\r\n我也引以为傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a43113a34eb131f5a2222870f2427f8dd83883ae1b6547203c39d713e4a98fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fdb18df8b70cfb81552f4e0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最近好像要举办活动。\r\n我也去收集一下情报好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae415fdca3d73c1a276317357b6e586ed55e4615241e681464ed911a161e19e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1cf71612441e4bc906403c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有活动正在举办啊。\r\n经验法则也是很重要的要素，\r\n你一定要参加看看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb28793b1c715ec3a58f9475e6fab8c6dfd43295ad32cf1b27fb144f54e3471",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36b6a0d8ab3b29ed1be045e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对手超乎我的预料……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12da13eeb78f1b236ff7ac6da71f40e6e4cca53c34138f19f1e4a06467b342b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/1002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353d22d2a0ad83650b695a4b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升咯。\r\n这都是努力不懈的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a765f741cd6c571096a64ff0c770c15ea425b4c072e14e814032568c9b9aa2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb954cf1ae8bff7d85aa4e96",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "品位を踏まえた装いは、いつどこに\r\n出かけるにも苦労しない。ある意味\r\n効率的な服装というわけさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "040f6b08af10590eb6d07f81f7b0a12f4f9851b91fdb1f3ef8a63b7c790b8494",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3400763e1895a89c2a24f9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "歌劇鑑賞に誘われたんだが\r\n君もどうだ？オペラオー君による\r\n鑑賞後の解説付きだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4595163fb7b4658ddd1b23a6d171eb059d14ff7ed0e09f9abe81a952d9b4c54a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1023/10026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:977ad649f95a6137cc8ad626",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
